lothlorien.message.disharmony.debug_friend=[lothlorien] disharmony points=%s level=%s calm=%s s friend progress=%s s (Friend)
## Context: Growth collision warning identifies sprout coordinates, translated obstacle block name and obstacle coordinates. Use Block.localizationKey; never derive a fake English block name from its namespace ID.
lothlorien.message.mallorn.blocked=§6The Great Mallorn sprout at %s cannot grow. Obstruction: %s at %s.
## Context: Planting warning for Great Mallorn nut: giant tree with a flet (wooden platform). Reserve about 40x40 horizontal blocks, 50 above and 5 below; light required, built blocks prevent growth. Breaking sprout returns nut.
lothlorien.message.mallorn.planted=§6The Great Mallorn nut grows into a giant tree with a wooden platform: about 40 blocks wide and 50 high, with roots 5 blocks deep. It needs light and space free of built blocks. Break the sprout to get the nut back.
## Context: Bone meal is explicitly refused; growth remains governed by natural random ticks and light.
lothlorien.message.mallorn.no_bonemeal=§7A Great Mallorn will not be hurried.
